template:
DISPATCH TO: {agent}
MODE: evolve
INTENT KD: {intent_kd}
SESSION DATE: {session_date}
SESSION ID: {session_id}
GENERATION: {generation}
SCOPE: {scope}
RESULT KD: {result_kd}
KD PATHS: {kd_paths}

---

Load the kd-system skill. Read the INTENT KD at {intent_kd}. Read all upstream KDs from KD PATHS (EXPLORATION, ANALYSIS, SPEC, PLAN, IMPL, REVIEW, AUDIT, COMPOSED, CHECKPOINT, PREFLIGHT KDs). Evolve the process per the scope above. Write the PROCESS KD and issue files (`knowledge/issues/*.md`). Memory entries (`knowledge/memory/*.json`) are written by the Scribe during EXTRACT. Produce a PROCESS KD at {result_kd} using the naming convention: knowledge/process-<name>-<session_id>-gen{generation}.md
